{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39994","headline":"白酒两瓶送崔侍御 · 徐夤","name":"白酒两瓶送崔侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪化霜融好泼醅，满壶冰冻向春开。\n求从白石洞中得，携向百花岩畔来。\n几夕露珠寒贝齿，一泓银水冷琼杯。\n湖边送与崔夫子，谁见嵇山尽日颓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}